\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 What from this course is most important for your specific project\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf0 1. OCR is not just preprocessing - it is a study variable\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Treat OCR choice and OCR quality as explicit experimental factors. The course repeatedly shows that parse defects directly shape downstream extraction errors.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 2. Use structured OCR outputs, not just raw text\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 PaddleOCR returns:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
