\ls58\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 confidence\
\ls58\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 polygons\
\ls58\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 preprocessed image.\uc0\u8232 That is far more valuable than plain OCR text for clinical QA and evidence grounding.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 3. Layout-aware parsing is probably necessary\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Multi-column, chart-heavy, and table-rich documents fail without layout modeling. Clinical analogues are common in pathology and radiology records.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 4. Reading order should be corrected before chunking for RAG\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 If the chunk text is assembled in the wrong order, retrieval quality and downstream extraction reliability will degrade.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 5. LLM reasoning can repair some OCR defects but also silently introduce \'93helpful\'94 errors\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 That is exactly why your project\'92s fabrication and omission framework is important.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 6. Region-specific tools are a strong next step\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Instead of one universal extraction prompt, the course suggests a future architecture where different document regions get specialized handlers.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 7. Visual grounding is valuable for clinician trust\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Boxes, page refs, and region overlays are useful not just technically but for clinical adoption and UI design.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
